<title>SPAIN: Spain's BCH to study 2-for-1 split on July 24.</title>
<headline>Spain's BCH to study 2-for-1 split on July 24.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Central Hispano, (BCH) said on Tuesday it would study a two-for-one share split at its board meeting on July 24.</p>
<p>&quot;The board will study (the split) on July 24, and if it is approved it will submit the operation to the next shareholders' meeting on September 18,&quot; said a BCH statement to stock market commission CNMV.</p>
</text>
